# Install

## Install py-wyrd

```bash
pip install py-wyrd
```

Or with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):

```bash
uv add py-wyrd
```

## Verify

```python
import wyrd
print(wyrd.__version__)
```

## Configure the registry URL

Set the server base URL before registering or reading cards:

```bash
export WYRD_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:8080
```

Or pass it directly to the client:

```python
import wyrd

client = wyrd.Client(base_url="http://localhost:8080")
```

## Run a local registry

The quickest path to a local registry is the Docker Compose stack in the repo
root. See [Run the server](/server/) for full configuration options.

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

